    /// Env `i`'s rows.
    ///
    /// # Safety
    /// Every address holds its column for a pool of `n > i` envs, alive, aligned and unaliased by
    /// anything but other envs' rows for the duration of the borrow; distinct `i` give disjoint
    /// output slices.
